OL,3,GNEWSARenfrew flooded after council
OL,4,Afailed to activate barriers during
OL,5,AStorm Boelo
OL,6,
OL,7,FA crucial part of a flood defence
OL,8,Fsystem that cost millions of pounds to
OL,9,Finstall in Renfrew was not activated by
OL,10,Fa council ahead of Storm Boelo, despite
OL,11,Fan amber weather warning.
OL,13,FRenfrewshire Council said "predicted
OL,14,Ftide levels and available forecast
OL,15,Fdata" for the storm did not meet the
OL,16,Fthreshold needed to use flood barriers.
OL,18,FWater from the River Clyde burst
OL,19,Fthrough on Saturday night and swamped
OL,20,Fshops and homes in the area, causing
OL,21,Fserious damage to local businesses.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
