OL,3,GNEWSARenfrew flooded after council
OL,4,Afailed to activate barriers during
OL,5,AStorm Boelo
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe North Renfrew Flood Prevention
OL,8,FScheme cost about #10m to install. When
OL,9,Fit was launched in 2016, officials
OL,10,Fdeclared it would provide protection
OL,11,Fagainst any extreme flooding events.
